    "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nLoading the cached report only in `firstUpdated` leaves the database card empty when Recorder becomes available after the page mounts, until the user starts an analysis or reopens the page.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open issue</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Load cached report when Recorder becomes available](https://github.com/home-assistant/frontend/pull/55982#discussion_r4601451757) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nThis follow-up to #55659 moves database analysis into the Storage page toolbar and simplifies the Database card\u2019s appearance.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Replaces the card\u2019s Analyze button with a localized toolbar refresh icon.\n- Moves database requests and loading/error state into the Storage page.\n- Removes database table row dividers while preserving the shared table\u2019s default styling.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `src/\u200btranslations/\u200ben.json` | Updates analysis instructions and the toolbar action label. |\r\n| `src/\u200bpanels/\u200bconfig/\u200bstorage/\u200bstorage-database-card.ts` | Receives analysis state from the parent, removes its action button, and hides row dividers. |\r\n| `src/\u200bpanels/\u200bconfig/\u200bstorage/\u200bha-config-section-storage.ts` | Adds the toolbar action and manages database requests and state. |\r\n| `src/\u200bcomponents/\u200bdata-table/\u200bha-data-table.ts` | Adds a configurable row-border width with the existing default. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>",
